%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as SQLite pager
  participant M as t.db-shm
  participant D as t.db
  participant W as t.db-wal
  Note over S,W: BEGIN IMMEDIATE (OP_Transaction)
  S->>M: READ0 & WRITE
  Note over S,W: INSERT (OP_Insert -- zero writes)
  S->>D: pread64 page 2 (4096B)
  Note over S,W: COMMIT (vdbeCommit -- zero t.db writes)
  S->>M: READ0->READ1
  S->>W: pwrite64 32B WAL hdr
  S->>W: sync t.db-wal & dir .
  S->>W: append frame 1 (24B + p2 4096B)
  S->>W: sync t.db-wal (COMMIT POINT)
  S->>M: unlock both
